        "about_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>GhostTint exists because window tint has always been a one-time decision. Once film goes on, that's the look and the light level you're stuck with — through winter glare, summer heat, and every drive in between. We built GhostTint to make that decision adjustable instead of permanent.</p><p>At the core is smart film wired to a wireless remote. Instead of one fixed tint percentage, GhostTint moves across seven preset levels — from a nearly clear 70% VLT down to a private 5% — so the same window can suit a bright afternoon or a dark night without swapping film.</p><p>There's no app to install and no separate battery to keep charged. The system draws power straight from your vehicle's ACC circuit, and the remote is the only interface — turn it up, turn it down, done.</p><p>We designed the install around real installers and real DIYers: a wiring path that runs through the door cavity, straightforward panel removal, and a step-by-step guide (with video) for anyone doing it themselves. If a step doesn't make sense, our <a href=\"/pages/installation\">installation</a> and <a href=\"/pages/contact\">support</a> pages are built to answer it directly.</p>"
          }
        }
